WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.171
An astronaut entered a space station.

2
00:00:07.172 --> 00:00:10.417
She drank from a pouch as she looked out a window.

3
00:00:10.418 --> 00:00:13.078
Suddenly she gasped.

4
00:00:13.079 --> 00:00:16.188
A small object was floating near the space station.

5
00:00:16.189 --> 00:00:18.206
She waved over another astronaut.

6
00:00:18.207 --> 00:00:21.683
"Officer Wells! What is that thing?"

7
00:00:21.684 --> 00:00:25.684
Officer Wells looked out the window.

8
00:00:25.685 --> 00:00:30.320
"I'm not sure, Dr. Chen. But it looks like a spaceship!"

9
00:00:30.321 --> 00:00:33.386
The astronauts put on their spacesuits and went outside.

10
00:00:33.387 --> 00:00:36.582
They hooked a rope onto the space station.

11
00:00:36.583 --> 00:00:40.281
Then they carefully floated toward the spaceship.

12
00:00:40.282 --> 00:00:44.186
Officer Wells grabbed it. "Let's bring it inside."

13
00:00:44.187 --> 00:00:48.638
Dr. Chen bit her lip. "I don't think that's a good idea."

14
00:00:48.639 --> 00:00:52.883
"It's fine," Officer Wells said.

15
00:00:52.884 --> 00:00:58.807
Officer Wells and Dr. Chen brought the tiny spaceship inside.

16
00:00:58.808 --> 00:01:01.817
A hatch popped open.

17
00:01:01.818 --> 00:01:04.227
They heard soft footsteps.

18
00:01:04.228 --> 00:01:07.312
Dr. Chen held her breath.

19
00:01:07.313 --> 00:01:12.775
A small, furry creature stepped out of the spaceship. "Furbit!"

20
00:01:12.776 --> 00:01:17.291
Officer Wells smiled. "Aww! How cute!"

21
00:01:17.292 --> 00:01:20.738
Furbit pulled a wrench off the wall.

22
00:01:20.739 --> 00:01:25.552
Chomp! Gulp! It ate the wrench.

23
00:01:25.553 --> 00:01:32.118
Then it ate a sleeping bag.

24
00:01:32.119 --> 00:01:34.580
"Furbit! Furbit!"

25
00:01:34.581 --> 00:01:41.006
Officer Wells laughed. "Wow! He's a hungry little guy!"

26
00:01:41.007 --> 00:01:47.395
Dr. Chen shook her head. "This was a bad idea!"

27
00:01:47.396 --> 00:01:51.895
*** "There is so much trash here," Terrell

28
00:01:51.896 --> 00:01:55.184
said. Roxy and her friends were doing volunteer work at a playground.

29
00:01:55.185 --> 00:01:57.254
They were cleaning up litter.

30
00:01:57.255 --> 00:02:00.375
Jack held a big trash bag.

31
00:02:00.376 --> 00:02:02.054
He opened and closed it.

32
00:02:02.055 --> 00:02:05.060
It looked like it was talking.

33
00:02:05.061 --> 00:02:09.799
"I eat trash!" Jack said in a monster voice.

34
00:02:09.800 --> 00:02:13.175
Everyone laughed.

35
00:02:13.176 --> 00:02:15.955
Mara carried some dirty wrappers over to Jack.

36
00:02:15.956 --> 00:02:20.021
"Open up, Trash Monster," she said.

37
00:02:20.022 --> 00:02:21.932
Jack opened the bag wide.

38
00:02:21.933 --> 00:02:23.961
Mara threw the wrappers in.

39
00:02:23.962 --> 00:02:27.434
Jack quickly closed the bag. "Chomp, chomp!"

40
00:02:27.435 --> 00:02:31.132
Mara shook her head and laughed.

41
00:02:31.133 --> 00:02:33.343
Then she picked up more litter.

42
00:02:33.344 --> 00:02:37.474
Roxy and Terrell found rusty cans under some shrubs.

43
00:02:37.475 --> 00:02:41.374
Terrell sighed. "This will take all day."

44
00:02:41.375 --> 00:02:44.861
Roxy nodded. "You might be right, Terrell."

45
00:02:44.862 --> 00:02:48.866
Mara walked over. "I wish Rocket Girl could help us.

46
00:02:48.867 --> 00:02:53.163
She could clean up this playground in a second."

47
00:02:53.164 --> 00:02:56.083
Terrell and Roxy looked at each other.

48
00:02:56.084 --> 00:02:58.544
Just then Roxy's watch beeped.

49
00:02:58.545 --> 00:03:03.849
"Oh!" Roxy said. "I see litter near the slide!"

50
00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:06.121
She ran to the slide.

51
00:03:06.122 --> 00:03:10.938
"Mayor Bloom," Roxy said. "Is there a problem?"

52
00:03:10.939 --> 00:03:13.252
"Rocket Girl," Mayor Bloom said.

53
00:03:13.253 --> 00:03:16.435
"I just got a call from the Space Agency.

54
00:03:16.436 --> 00:03:18.996
They lost contact with their space station.

55
00:03:18.997 --> 00:03:21.060
They're worried it was destroyed.

56
00:03:21.061 --> 00:03:23.263
They asked me to call you."

57
00:03:23.264 --> 00:03:25.697
"Don't worry, Mayor," Roxy said.

58
00:03:25.698 --> 00:03:30.478
"I'll find out what happened!"

